AUv3: publish clap.preset-discovery as factory presets; factory presets first

- auv3_audiounit.mm: factoryPresets from Clap::PresetIndex (as the AUv2 wrapper does),
  currentPreset loads one through clap.preset-load, and a preset the plugin loads by
  itself (clap_host_preset_load.loaded) becomes the current preset.
- preset_discovery.cpp: sort factory content before user content, so saving a user
  preset never renumbers the factory ones (AU and VST3 numbers are positions).

